Ṭhākur"},"title":["Śuddha-bhakata"],"author":["by Śrīla Bhakti Vinod Ṭhākur"],"verses":[{"number":"1","text":["śuddha-bhakata-    charaṇa-reṇu","    bhajana-anukūla","bhakata-sevā    parama-siddhi","    prema-latikāra mūla"],"translation":["The dust of pure devotees’ feet is favourable to devotion. Serving the devotees is the supreme fulfilment and the root of the creeper of divine love."],"isLong":false},{"number":"2","text":["mādhava-tithi    bhakti-jananī","    yatane pālana kari","kṛṣṇa-vasati    vasati bali’","    parama ādare vari"],"translation":["I carefully observe the holy days related to Mādhava. They are the mother of devotion. With great adoration, I embrace the abode of Kṛṣṇa as my own."],"isLong":false},{"number":"3","text":["gaura āmāra    ye-saba sthāne","    karala bhramaṇa raṅge","se-saba sthāna    heriba āmi","    praṇayi-bhakata-saṅge"],"translation":["In the company of loving devotees, I behold all the places my Gaurasundar visited during His Pastimes."],"isLong":false},{"number":"4","text":["mṛdaṅga-vādya    śunite mana","    avasara sadā yāche","gaura-vihita    kīrtana śuni’","    ānande hṛdaya nāche"],"translation":["My heart always begs for the opportunity to hear the sound of the mṛdaṅga. Hearing the kīrtan prescribed by Śrī Gaurasundar, my heart dances with joy."],"isLong":false},{"number":"5","text":["yugala-mūrti    dekhiyā mora","    parama-ānanda haya","prasāda-sevā    karite haya","    sakala prapañcha jaya"],"translation":["Beholding the Deity forms of the Divine Couple, I feel the greatest joy. By honouring prasād, I overcome the entire material illusion."],"isLong":false},{"number":"6","text":["ye-dina gṛhe    bhajana dekhi","    gṛhete goloka bhāya","charaṇa-sīdhu    dekhiyā gaṅgā","    sukha nā sīmā pāya"],"translation":["On days when I see devotional service taking place in my home, I feel that Goloka has manifested there. Seeing the Ganges, the nectar from the Lord’s feet, my happiness has no limit."],"isLong":false},{"number":"7","text":["tulasī dekhi’    juḍāya prāṇa","    mādhava-toṣaṇī jāni’","gaura-priya    śāka-sevane","    jīvana sārthaka māni"],"translation":["Seeing Tulasī Devī soothes my soul, for I know she pleases Mādhava. Honouring śāk, Śrī Gaurasundar’s favourite, I consider my life successful."],"isLong":false},{"number":"8","text":["bhakativinoda    kṛṣṇa-bhajane","    anukūla pāya yāhā","prati-divase    parama-sukhe","    svīkāra karaye tāhā"],"translation":["Whatever Bhakti Vinod obtains that is favourable to Kṛṣṇa’s service, he accepts every day with the greatest joy."],"isLong":false}],"resources":{"audio":[{"title":"Srila B.N. Acharya Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/kostya-netrebenko/083-suddhabhakatacharanarenu-11","personSlug":"srila-b-n-acharya-maharaj"},{"title":"Kamal Krishna Prabhu","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/jayasri-sound/31-suddha-bhakata","personSlug":"kamal-krishna-prabhu"},{"title":"Manasa Krishna Prabhu","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/huron/suddha-bhakata-charana-renu","personSlug":"manasa-krishna-prabhu"}]},"hasWbw":false,"hasVersesText":true,"hasVersesTranslations":true,"hasLongVerses":false,"fullInlineWbw":false},"telegraphUrl":"https://telegra.ph/Śuddha-bhakata-02-22"},"head":{"canonical":"/en-pe/shiuddha-bhakata-charana-renu/","description":"Śuddha-bhakata — a Vaiṣṇava song by Śrīla Bhakti Vinod Ṭhākur with lyrics, English translation and word-by-word meaning. From Pocket Kirtan Guide.","title":"Śuddha-bhakata. by Śrīla Bhakti Vinod Ṭhākur | Kirtan Site"},"kind":"song","route":{"kind":"item","bookId":"en-pe","slug":"shiuddha-bhakata-charana-renu"}}